    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d523">

                <pb facs="0696" n="572" xml:id="pg572"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">861.77/1977: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting President of the Technical Board</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Johnson</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary
                        of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Harbin</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1921-03-04T17:00:00+08:26"><hi rendition="#italic">March 4, 1921—5
                                p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received March 5—10:21
                    a.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>Manchuria Station frontier opened with some restrictions by the Chinese
                    authorities today. This should improve Chinese Eastern earnings so they can get
                    through March but will not enable them to make any headway against overdue
                    liabilities.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Johnson</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
